<title>UK: July Norway Statfjord schedules unchanged 30 cargo.</title>
<headline>July Norway Statfjord schedules unchanged 30 cargo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's July Statfjord crude loading programme has scheduled 30 standard cargoes of 855,000 barrels each, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The July Statfjord programme is unchanged from June, the traders added.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
